Package: FlexAssays
Type: Package
Title: Flexible Container for Matrix-Like Assays with Logical Dimension Mapping
Version: 0.99.5
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuchen", "Li", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"), 
           email = "ycli1995@outlook.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
    )
Description: A framework for organizing multiple matrix-like assays with 
    different dimensions. Uses logical matrices to manage shared or unique 
    row/column names across assays, while controlling dimension flexibility 
    through rule-based settings. Designed for developers handling complex assay 
    structures in bioinformatics workflows.
